This project builds on the open-source Switch .so-loader lineage -- Andy Nguyen,
fgsfds, TheOfficialFloW, ChanseyIsTheBest, and the Hitman GO / Zookeeper DX /
PvZ Fusion / Deus Ex GO ports, and the CloverPit NX port, from which the video
decoder, GL upload/draw path and audio mixing in r3_video.c are derived. The
shared loader and shim infrastructure
(so_util, libc_shim, jni_fake, unity_jni, opensles, nx_pointer,
android_native_unity, asset_pack, and the diagnostic layer) originates there and
remains under the MIT licence its authors granted. Copyright in those portions
stays with them.

